# WORKSPACE-PATH:allow-fixture (directory scope)

This directory holds fixture data for the `home-path-tilde` rendering test.

`workspace-hover.expected.txt` is an expected-output snapshot; the foreign
absolute path it contains is the value the renderer under test is asserted to
produce, so it cannot be replaced with a placeholder without deleting the
assertion. A `.txt` snapshot has no comment syntax, which is why the exemption
is declared here instead of inside the file.

Delete this file if the fixture stops containing a foreign absolute path.
